# Deterministic demo runs are quarantined here: they are not native evidence.
#
# `driver.js --mode=demo` (and every other non-native mode) writes its artifacts and its
# `runs.demo.json` ledger into this directory. No byte in here may ever be committed, cited by a
# record in `runs.v2.json`, or counted as a native-browser run — the directory is kept so the
# quarantine location exists and is obvious, while its contents stay untracked.
*
!.gitignore
